 ('hc-demo-sleep-literacy',1,'sleep-better','demo','TEST ONLY: How to read a claim','Synthetic non-medical fixture for testing the in-game Knowledge interface. This card illustrates that one persons story does not establish what happens for others, and it provides no sleep guidance. No external source is asserted.','[{"label":"TEST ONLY synthetic interface content - no external source","url":"#test-only"}]'::jsonb,'{}','What is this TEST ONLY lesson designed to practice?','[{"id":"interface","label":"Using a learning interaction in the demo"},{"id":"treatment","label":"Proving a treatment works"}]'::jsonb,'mind_sleep','reviewed',true,'test-fixture',now()),
 ('hc-demo-gout-literacy',1,'gout-uric-acid','demo','TEST ONLY: Check the learning path','Synthetic non-medical fixture confirming that the saved Gout / uric acid Journey opens its own Knowledge path. This is not information about gout, a diagnosis, or a treatment recommendation. No external source is asserted.','[{"label":"TEST ONLY synthetic interface content - no external source","url":"#test-only"}]'::jsonb,'{}','What does this TEST ONLY card confirm?','[{"id":"topic","label":"The selected Journey opens a matching demo content path"},{"id":"diagnosis","label":"That the player has a confirmed diagnosis"}]'::jsonb,'health_knowledge','reviewed',true,'test-fixture',now())
